msgstr "Numeric ID for the conversion action (digits only). Used for Google Ads API uploads."

#: templates/settings-page.php:488
msgid "Forbedrede konverteringer:"
msgstr "Enhanced conversions:"

#: templates/settings-page.php:489
msgid "Slå \"Enhanced conversions\" til på selve konverteringshandlingen i Google Ads (Tools > Conversions > din konverteringshandling). Uden det bruger Google ikke de hashede kundedata TrackWP sender."
msgstr "Turn on \"Enhanced conversions\" on the conversion action itself in Google Ads (Tools > Conversions > your conversion action). Without it, Google will not use the hashed customer data TrackWP sends."

#: templates/settings-page.php:492
msgid "Optællingsindstilling:"
msgstr "Count setting:"

#: templates/settings-page.php:493
msgid "Sæt konverteringshandlingens \"Count\" til \"Every\" (\"Hver\"), ikke \"One\" (\"Én pr. klik\"). gbraid/wbraid (iOS-app-klik) afvises af Google med fejlen ONE_PER_CLICK_CONVERSION_ACTION_NOT_PERMITTED_WITH_BRAID, hvis handlingen tæller \"Én pr. klik\" — det gælder typisk for køb."
msgstr "Set the conversion action's \"Count\" to \"Every\", not \"One\". gbraid/wbraid (iOS app clicks) are rejected by Google with the error ONE_PER_CLICK_CONVERSION_ACTION_NOT_PERMITTED_WITH_BRAID if the action counts \"One\" — this typically applies to purchases."

#: templates/settings-page.php:498
msgid "GA4-import til Google Ads"
